  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transforming the Law, Constructing Citizenship</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FDDHMMA will expand its course that trains for non-lawyers as legal specialists (juristas populares) to reach two classes of 30 students each in Joo Pessoa and develop a shortened course to meet the growing demands of rural communities in Paraba. Students will learn about civic participation, how public policy is formulated, alternative dispute resolution and the law related to domestic violence law, and will visit relevant public offices. (BR-861)</narrative>
  </description>
